{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/10199/", "pk": 10199, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/", "pk": 4476, "shortname": "baycitybike", "name": "Bay City Bike", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Golden Gate Bridge to Sausalito Bike Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 6, "unicode": "Golden Gate Bridge to Sausalito Bike Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "Call for Availability", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": -4650, "description": "###👉 Add your bike to the cart to see your discount\n\n\nRide across the Golden Gate Bridge on a scenic guided bike tour from San Francisco to Sausalito. Explore waterfront paths, historic sites, and stunning viewpoints before enjoying free time in this charming bayside town.\n\n\n\n***This tour is for all ages!***\nBeginner to Novice - All Ages - Family Fun\n_______________________\n\n##Activity details\n\nExperience one of San Francisco’s most iconic adventures on a guided bike tour from Fisherman’s Wharf to Sausalito. \n\nMeet your expert guide, get fitted on a comfortable regular bike or electric bike equipped with storage and a map, and set off along the city’s scenic waterfront. With easy, mostly flat paths and plenty of stops for photos, this ride offers beautiful views and fascinating stories that bring the city’s history to life.\n\nFollow your guide past Fort Mason, the sailboat-filled Marina, and the lush Presidio as you make your way toward the Golden Gate Bridge. Ride across the bridge on a wide bike path and enjoy sweeping views of the bay, Alcatraz, and the city skyline. Continue through Vista Point and Old Fort Baker, a historic army post with some of the best vantage points in the area.\nThe tour finishes in the picturesque town of Sausalito, where you can browse shops, art galleries, and waterfront restaurants at your leisure. You’re welcome to keep your bike until closing hours to explore more on your own. \n\nRiders may return to San Francisco by biking back or by ferry (tickets sold separately). \n\nPlease arrive 30 minutes before the tour start time to ***2661 Taylor Street TOUR CENTER*** location in Fisherman's Wharf.\n\n###What's included\n\n* 2.5 to 3 hour guided bike tour with a local expert \n* Includes full-day bike use\n* Helmet, lock, and map\n\n###Itinerary \n\n* Departs: 10:00 AM (year-round) & 2:00 PM (March–October)\n* Duration: 2.5 to 3 hours\n* Distance: 8 miles (to Sausalito)", "description_text": "Begin your bike tour of the Bay Area at Fisherman's Wharf and then make your way along the coast, spotting sea lions, dolphins, military forts, and San Francisco's most elegant of neighborhoods. Cross the Golden Gate Bridge and into sunny Sausalito on this three-hour tour.", "description_bullets": "Bike the Bay Area in a new model bike\n\nRental includes bike, front handlebar bag, rack, and takeaway map\n\nRide from San Francisco's Fisherman's Wharf over the Golden Gate Bridge into Sausalito", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "Thank you for choosing Bay City Bike Rentals & Tours! This is a confirmation for your reservation.\n\nThe Golden Gate Bridge to Sausalito Tour departs promptly  **on time** at our **2661 Taylor Street TOUR CENTER** location in Fisherman's Wharf.\n\nPlease arrive at least 30 minutes prior to departure time. This extra 30-minute time is to complete paper work, fit helmets, get a bike overview, use restrooms, etc. The tour leave sharp at tour time and late arrivals cannot be accommodated. \n\nPlease note, tour guide gratuity is not included in tour pricing and should be given directly to tour guides.\n\n**Arrival instructions and information**\n•\tPlease bring a valid ID and a Credit Card with you to pick up your bikes.\n•\tWe take a credit card pre-authorization on all rentals and tours, starting at $100 per bike. The authorized amount is held until we have the safe return of all rental equipment. The various amounts required for bike types is as follows: $150 City Bike; $200 Performance; $300 Tandem; $600 Electric bike; $700 Road Aluminum; $1,200 Road Carbon.", "cancellation_notes": "**Cancellation and No-Show Policy:** \n• Cancellations made 72 hours prior to reservation date & time are fully refunded. \n• Cancellations within 72 hours of reserved date & time are charged in full, and considered non-refundable. No-shows are charged in full, and considered non-refundable. \n\n**Changed Reservation Date Policy:**\n• If a reservation date is changed from its original date, the changed reservation disqualifies the above cancellation policy. The changed reservation date is charged in full, is considered non-refundable, and is charged in full.\n\n**Reservation Terms & Conditions:**\n• Reservation is for the day only unless rented for multiple days; bikes kept overnight are charged an overnight fee starting at $25 per bike. Bikes MUST BE STORED INDOORS overnight otherwise they will be stolen; we hold your deposit until the bikes are safely returned\n• Reservation is valid for redemption for bikes/equipment/tours noted on this invoice receipt. It is not transferable, has no cash value, and may be redeemed only once.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "2.5 - 3 Hours - All Ages - Add your bike to the cart to see your discount", "short_description": "Guided scenic bike tour from Fisherman’s Wharf across the Golden Gate Bridge to Sausalito with free time to explore the town.", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/vEVpb0nQXmA7la4TnQhR", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/vEVpb0nQXmA7la4TnQhR", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/10199/images/536907/", "pk": 536907, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/MlBgeZ9KTJjEGjNdRos6", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/MlBgeZ9KTJjEGjNdRos6", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/10199/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/MlBgeZ9KTJjEGjNdRos6", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/MlBgeZ9KTJjEGjNdRos6", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/10199/images/1685067/", "pk": 1685067, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/UtPWgylITg6U8tyqaOY6", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/UtPWgylITg6U8tyqaOY6", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/10199/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/UtPWgylITg6U8tyqaOY6", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/UtPWgylITg6U8tyqaOY6", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/10199/images/1685069/", "pk": 1685069, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/YK6YnSmVSkq9dCBXPopp", "image